     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : DéfinitionStructure fr-lm-patient-summary-document</b></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"xhtTableBorder0\"><tr class=\"xhtRowBorder1\"><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Le nom logique de l'élément\">Nom</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Informations sur l'utilisation de l'élément\">Drapeaux</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Nombre minimum et maximum de fois que l'élément peut apparaître dans l'instance\">Card.</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"; width: 100px\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Référence au type de l'élément\">Type</a></th><th scope=\"col\" style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Informations supplémentaires sur l'élément\">Description et contraintes</a><span style=\"float: right\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/FHIR/ig-guidance/readingIgs.html#table-views\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/></a></span></th></tr><tr class=\"xhtRowBorder0 xhtRowEven\"><td style=\"background-image: url(tbl_bck1.png)\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0 xhtCellNoWrap\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: inherit\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><img src=\"icon_element.gif\" alt=\"\" style=\"background-color: white; background-color: inherit\" title=\"Element\" class=\"hierarchy\"/> <a href=\"StructureDefinition-fr-lm-patient-summary-document-definitions.html#fr-lm-patient-summary-document\" title=\"Éléments d'en-tête et de corps d'une Synthèse Médicale (International Patient Summary) contenant l'ensemble des sections cliniques et administratives.\">fr-lm-patient-summary-document</a><a name=\"fr-lm-patient-summary-document\"> </a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"/><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">0</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">..</span><span class=\"xhtPieceDeEmphasized\">*</span></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\"><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-metier-document-core/StructureDefinition-FRLMHeaderDocument.html\">FRLMHeaderDocument(0.1.0)</a></td><td style=\"\" class=\"hierarchy xhtCellBorder0\">Modèle logique métier - FR LM Patient Summary Document<br/><br/>Éléments définis dans les ancêtres :<a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-metier-document-core/StructureDefinition-FRLMHeaderDocument.html\" title=\"Identifiant unique du document et/ou du lot de version du meme document.\">identifier</a>, <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-metier-document-core/StructureDefinition-FRLMHeaderDocument.html\" title=\"Type de document.\">documentType</a>, <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-metier-document-core/StructureDefinition-FRLMHeaderDocument.html\" title=\"Titre du document.\">documentTitle</a>, <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-metier-document-core/StructureDefinition-FRLMHeaderDocument.html\" title=\"Date de création du document.\">date</a>, <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-metier-document-core/StructureDefinition-FRLMHeaderDocument.html\" title=\"Niveau de confidentialité du document.\">confidentiality</a>, <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-metier-document-core/StructureDefinition-FRLMHeaderDocument.html\" title=\"Langue principale du document.\">language</a>, <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-metier-document-core/StructureDefinition-FRLMHeaderDocument.html\" title=\"Numéro de version du document.\">version</a>, <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-metier-document-core/StructureDefinition-FRLMHeaderDocument.html\" title=\"Statut du document.\">status</a>, <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-metier-document-core/StructureDefinition-FRLMHeaderDocument.html\" title=\"Evènement documenté et notamment le cadre d'exercice.\">eventType</a>, <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-metier-document-core/StructureDefinition-FRLMHeaderDocument.html\" title=\"Patient / Usager.\">subject</a>, <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-metier-document-core/StructureDefinition-FRLMHeaderDocument.html\" title=\"Auteur du document.\">author[x]</a>, <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-metier-document-core/StructureDefinition-FRLMHeaderDocument.html\" title=\"Opérateur de saisie.\">dataEnterer</a>, <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-metier-document-core/StructureDefinition-FRLMHeaderDocument.html\" title=\"Informateur ayant fourni des informations utiles à la production du document.\">informant</a>, <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-metier-document-core/StructureDefinition-FRLMHeaderDocument.html\" title=\"Structure chargée de la conservation du document.\">custodian</a>, <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-metier-document-core/StructureDefinition-FRLMHeaderDocument.html\" title=\"Destinataire prévu du document.\">intendedRecipient</a>, <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-metier-document-core/StructureDefinition-FRLMHeaderDocument.html\" title=\"Responsable du document.\">legalAuthentication</a>, <a href=\"h